### IntelliJ HTTP Client: run each request with the gutter ▶ icon.
### Change the port if you started the app with SERVER_PORT.
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Happy path: both systems answer, 6 documents
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vehicles/1HGCM82633A004352/documents
X-Correlation-Id: demo-happy-path

### Service System is slow (5 s): partial result after the 2 s timeout
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vehicles/5YJSA1E26HF000001/documents

### Service System returns 500: partial result, upstream error not leaked
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vehicles/WBA3A5C51DF000002/documents

### Sales System resets the connection: partial result
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vehicles/2T1BURHE0JC000004/documents

### No documents in either system: 200 with an empty list
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vehicles/JH4KA7561PC000003/documents

### Invalid VIN: 400 application/problem+json
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vehicles/NOT-A-VIN/documents

### Health (includes documentSources)
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus

### OpenAPI contract
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs
